  "scope": "Simplify private SignedPairs factors_one proof via positive product and divisibility",
  "validation": "Paired target and all three tracked direct module clients pass. Four current-source external direct provider pairs match prior producer receipts; all three client object pairs match byte-for-byte. Combined target/client-pinned probes match 39 target names/type/axiom reports and global default simp and instance lists.",
  "limitations": [
    "Foundation and Mathlib direct inputs and wider project transitive closure remain cached; matching direct producer pairs do not establish a full current-source closure.",
    "Probe comparisons do not establish equality of proof bodies or all persistent environment extensions. Single shared-load timing samples are not a general benchmark.",
    "An exploratory missing-Foundation check log was overwritten; the corrected check retains expected unknown-lemma diagnostics. A provisional target probe lacks full paired input pins.",
    "The independent audit initially selected the wrong prior FoundationHACurrentNoZero2011 phase; its failed log and corrected postcommit audit are included.",
    "Compiled objects and cached overlays are omitted; receipts preserve hashes and paths, and independent byte verification requires external objects."
  ],
